```

### 🔥 Sabse important 10 commands

Agar abhi beginner ho, **pehle ye 10 pakke karo**:

```bash
git status
git add .
git commit -m "message"
git branch
git switch main
git switch -c feature/name
git merge feature/name
git pull
git push
git fetch
```

**One-line memory:**

> **STATUS → ADD → COMMIT → BRANCH → SWITCH → MERGE → PULL → PUSH**.
